  "details": "In my view, in third person, my arms freeze in place when I run, but everyone else sees it as the default desktop run animation. I thought that's just how things worked, but apparently your arms freeze when you hold something. My suggestion is, why can't my arms just freeze all the time for others like I see it when I move? People keep mistaking me for a desktop user. It looks so much nicer, and it can be easier to see who's in 3rd person.",
